     "anchor": "why-this-keeps-cards-honest",
     "title": "Why this keeps cards honest",
     "text": "Silence cannot lie. A producer that stops writing is dimmed, then retired, by derivation. Itis never shown as running, and its declared state is left untouched for when it returns. Glitches cannot end work. A session that ended, a lost connection or a failed hook changesonly the "
