   "section": "Reference",
   "group": "CLI",
   "html": "<p><code>relo notify</code> sends one notification. Use it sparingly: a work's finish outcome already is the\nnotification, so <code>relo notify</code> is for a result that has no open work, such as a backup that ran\nwithout a card. It never asks: a question is <code>relo ask</code>. <code>relo notify withdraw</code> removes a delivered\nnotification from the phone. When notifications alert and when they stay quiet:\n<a href=\"/docs/concepts/notifications\">Notifications</a>.</p>\n<figure class=\"docs-code\" data-language=\"sh\"><button class=\"docs-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"relo notify &quot;Nightly backup finished: 42 GB in 18 minutes&quot; --title &quot;nightly-backup&quot;\" hidden>Copy</button><pre><code>relo notify &quot;Nightly backup finished: 42 GB in 18 minutes&quot; --title &quot;nightly-backup&quot;</code></pre></figure>\n<h2 id=\"commands\">Commands <a class=\"docs-anchor\" href=\"#commands\" aria-label=\"Link to Commands\">#</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"relo-notify\">relo notify <a class=\"docs-anchor\" href=\"#relo-notify\" aria-label=\"Link to relo notify\">#</a></h3>\n<figure class=\"docs-code\" data-language=\"sh\"><button class=\"docs-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"relo notify BODY... [--dry-run] [--title TEXT] [--summary TEXT] [--format text|markdown]\n    [--markdown] [--image URL] [--url URL] [--device ID] [--idempotency-key KEY]\n    [--source NAME] [--project NAME] [--topic NAME] [--thread-name NAME]\n    [--task-title TEXT] [--computer NAME] [--account NAME] [--stdin]\" hidden>Copy</button><pre><code>relo notify BODY... [--dry-run] [--title TEXT] [--summary TEXT] [--format text|markdown]\n    [--markdown] [--image URL] [--url URL] [--device ID] [--idempotency-key KEY]\n    [--source NAME] [--project NAME] [--topic NAME] [--thread-name NAME]\n    [--task-title TEXT] [--computer NAME] [--account NAME] [--stdin]</code></pre></figure>\n<p>Sparingly: a one-shot message about a finished outcome. Never a question. Inside a session the topic comes from the session's card.</p>\n<p>Also: <code>relo notify send</code>.</p>\n<div class=\"docs-table\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Option</th>\n<th>What it does</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--dry-run</code></td>\n<td>Check everything locally (identity, limits, the plan) and print {ok,dryRun,would:{command,body}}: no request, no login needed.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--title TEXT</code></td>\n<td>Message or activity title. Longer text is shortened at a word boundary with an ellipsis, and the reply carries a note.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--summary TEXT</code></td>\n<td>Short banner text for a long body; the full body stays readable in the app. Longer text is shortened, with a note.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>`--format text</td>\n<td>markdown`</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--markdown</code></td>\n<td>Shorthand for --format markdown.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--image URL</code></td>\n<td>Public https:// image shown with the message and as the sender avatar.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--url URL</code></td>\n<td>Opened from the message: https:// link, an app link (your-app://path), or shortcuts://run-shortcut?name=...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--device ID</code></td>\n<td>Target one phone by ID (repeatable). Omit to reach every phone.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--idempotency-key KEY</code></td>\n<td>Retry-safe key: a replay returns the first result without a second push.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--source NAME</code></td>\n<td>Sender name shown on the phone, e.g. Claude Code or Release bot. Auto-detected for Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode, Gemini CLI and Cursor; any other harness sets RELO_SOURCE=&quot;<harness>&quot;.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--project NAME</code></td>\n<td>Project the message is filed under. Defaults to the git repository name.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--topic NAME</code></td>\n<td>Thread within the project, e.g. a task or PR name. Messages with the same topic group together.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--thread-name NAME</code></td>\n<td>Alias for --topic.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--task-title TEXT</code></td>\n<td>Short title for the current task.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--computer NAME</code></td>\n<td>Computer name shown on the card. Automatic: RELO_COMPUTER, else the Mac's name, else the hostname.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--account NAME</code></td>\n<td>Agent account shown on the card (e.g. work, personal). Automatic: RELO_ACCOUNT, else <code>relo account NAME</code> (any harness), else the name of a custom config folder ($CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR, $CODEX_HOME).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--stdin</code></td>\n<td>Read a JSON object from stdin; flags win over its fields.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<h3 id=\"relo-notify-withdraw\">relo notify withdraw <a class=\"docs-anchor\" href=\"#relo-notify-withdraw\" aria-label=\"Link to relo notify withdraw\">#</a></h3>\n<figure class=\"docs-code\" data-language=\"sh\"><button class=\"docs-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"relo notify withdraw ID [--idempotency-key KEY]\" hidden>Copy</button><pre><code>relo notify withdraw ID [--idempotency-key KEY]</code></pre></figure>\n<p>Remove a delivered notification from the phone.</p>\n<div class=\"docs-table\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Option</th>\n<th>What it does</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--idempotency-key KEY</code></td>\n<td>Retry-safe key: a replay returns the first result without a second push.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n",
